# Resume request delivery.
#
# The site is static, so there is no server of ours to receive submissions.
# Set VITE_FORM_ENDPOINT to a hosted form service and submissions arrive in
# your Gmail. Formspree is the quickest option:
#
#   1. Create a free account and add a form.
#   2. Copy the endpoint it gives you, e.g. https://formspree.io/f/abcdwxyz
#   3. Put it below, and add a "Reply to" field pointing at your address in the
#      Formspree dashboard so you can reply straight from the notification.
#
# Leave VITE_FORM_ENDPOINT empty and the form still works: it composes a
# prefilled mailto: and hands off to the visitor's own mail app.
VITE_FORM_ENDPOINT=

# Where the mailto: fallback sends. Also used as the From/To on hosted services.
VITE_OWNER_EMAIL=manideepdaram@gmail.com
